    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35283" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδοσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>striking of the key-note</i>(cf.foreg.<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				398b26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Anon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> V. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνδόσιμον</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>imparting</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ὑγρότητος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					1.15.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ εἴδους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Ph.</u>
					440.8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς πολλὰς οὐσίας ἐνδόσεις εἶναι
					κατὰ ἔλλαμψιν ἀπὸ τῆς μιᾶς οὐσίας προϊούσας εἰς
					πάντα ὄντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					100
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>giving in, alleviation, remission</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>relaxation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόνου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>yielding, giving way</i>, of pillars, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				15.3.10
			</span></i>; of sand, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.30
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				78.3
			</span></i>: metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				31
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.457a
				</span></i>
			; <i>way out</i> of a difficulty, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				137.21
			</span></i>; <i>retirement</i>, of troops, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				5.100.2
			</span></i>.</div>
